      },
      "text": "After breakfast, meet your guide at 08:00. On the way, stop at Quiriguá to see the largest Maya stela.\n\nContinue to Puerto Barrios, stopping for lunch. You arrive in Livingston in the afternoon. The last stretch to the hotel is by boat.\n\nAfter checking in, you can relax, go for a swim or go kayaking.\n\nOvernight in Livingston at Hotel Villa Caribe."
